  "summary": "I hold a B.S. in Computer Science from the University of Wisconsin-Milwaukee and currently work as a full-time Software Engineer at Astronautics Corporation of America. My academic background includes experience with Java, Python, C, SML, MIPS assembly, and HTML/CSS, and I continue to deepen my expertise primarily in Python and C in my professional role.\n\nIn addition to my civilian career, I have proudly served in the Air National Guard since 2015 as an intelligence analyst. Through this role, I have developed strong skills in critical thinking, public speaking, and synthesizing complex information using a variety of databases.\n\nThe combination of my technical education, hands-on engineering experience, and military service has equipped me with a unique and adaptable skill set of which I am excited to share!",
